Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FallingBillboardOnRoad" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obs1 ;
    :hasEvidence :ind1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle .
:obs1 a :Billboard .
:ind1 a :FallingObjectIndicator .
:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Billboard falling into the driving lane creating a collision hazard" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Billboard falling into the driving lane, obstructing the path of the ego vehicle.
Severity Score: 0.90